      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#1",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.5,
          "bg": "t3_red_flags",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "4つの初期警告サイン。犠牲者を二度と出さないために。",
          "characters_spoken": 26,
          "est_dur_s": 3.93,
          "src_script": "5.04#1 · 5.08#11"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#2",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_gift_drowned",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "第1の兆候：幼少期のマクドナルドの3徴候。10歳の頃から始まった意図的かつ計画的な動物虐待。",
          "characters_spoken": 46,
          "est_dur_s": 7.83,
          "src_script": "5.05#1 · 5.05#2 · 5.05#4 · 5.05#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#3",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_gift_drowned",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "これは共感能力の著しい欠如と暴力のエスカレーションを示す、見逃してはならない重大な警告でした。",
          "characters_spoken": 47,
          "est_dur_s": 8.0,
          "src_script": "5.05#6"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#4",
          "role": "C",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_coal_furnace",
          "motion": "pan",
          "text": "第2の兆候：家庭内での極端な精神的虐待。子どもを閉鎖空間に隔離し、長期間にわたり尊厳を否定すること。",
          "characters_spoken": 50,
          "est_dur_s": 8.52,
          "src_script": "5.05#7 · 5.05#8"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#5",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t3_fantasy_spiral",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "第3の兆候：現実から切り離された支配の妄想世界に一人で深く没頭し、武器に異常な関心を持つこと。",
          "characters_spoken": 47,
          "est_dur_s": 7.64,
          "src_script": "5.06#1 · 5.06#2"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#6",
          "role": "D",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.03,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_self_observation",
          "motion": "push",
          "text": "そして第4の兆候：高い知性と感情の冷たさ。大人を言い負かし操る能力を持ちながら、他人の痛みに涙を流せないこと。",
          "characters_spoken": 55,
          "est_dur_s": 8.94,
          "src_script": "5.06#3 · 5.06#4"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#7",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.7,
          "bg": "t3_life_sentence",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "エドマンド・ケンパーは天才的な頭脳と体力を与えられながら、虐待のるつぼの中で破壊兵器へと変貌しました。",
          "characters_spoken": 51,
          "est_dur_s": 7.72,
          "src_script": "5.08#8 · 5.08#9"
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK5.01#8",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.8,
          "bg": "t3_closing_desk",
          "motion": "still",
          "text": "悪を鉄格子の向こうに閉じ込めるのは法の役目です。しかし、子どもの心の傷を家庭で癒すことこそが悪を防ぐ唯一の道です。",
          "characters_spoken": 57,
          "est_dur_s": 8.63,
          "src_script": "5.08#10 · 5.08#11"
        },
        {
